# Gold ICT Pro — Phase 9 Implementation Charter

**Purpose:** Precise build roadmap for GLM. This charter governs *how* Phase 9 gets built, in what order, with what tests, and when a module is allowed to freeze. It does not redefine architecture (see the Phase 9 Architecture Specification) — it operationalizes it.

---

## 1. Build Order (mirrors runtime dependency order)

1. MTF Structure Adapter
2. Liquidity Hierarchy Engine
3. Premium/Discount Array Engine
4. Fair Value Gap Engine
5. Order Block Engine
6. Market Structure Shift Engine
7. Breaker Block Engine
8. Institutional POI Aggregator
9. Confidence Scoring Engine
10. Trade Rating Engine
11. Institutional Event Log
