## 6. Freeze/Change Authority

| Tier | Who can change it | Process |
|---|---|---|
| Tier 1 | No one, post-freeze | Requires a formal new phase/version to reopen, not a patch |
| Tier 2 | Module owner | Documented parameter change + re-run Gates 1–4 for that module only |
| Tier 3 | Module owner | Free iteration, no re-audit of upstream required |

---

## 7. Exit Criteria for Phase 9 (when GLM can consider Phase 9 "done")

- [ ] All 13 modules have passed all 5 gates.
- [ ] Institutional Audit shows zero unresolved mismatches across the full historical test range.
- [ ] Statistics Engine produces at least one full session-boundary report with no missing/null dimensions.
- [ ] Phase 10 Compatibility Review (separate document) has no unresolved blocking gaps.
